{"id":"irgendwo","lemma":"irgendwo","pos":"adv","rank":505,"glosses":["somewhere","anywhere (in one particular place)"],"ipa":"/ˈɪʁɡəntˌvoː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9a/De-irgendwo.ogg/De-irgendwo.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Können wir uns irgendwo treffen?","en":"Can we meet somewhere?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/699189","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,{"g":"to meet"}]},{"text":"Kenne ich dich von irgendwo?","en":"Do I know you from somewhere?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"from / of"},null]},{"text":"Ich gehe nie irgendwo hin.","en":"I never go anywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566660","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"never, never at all"},null,{"g":"gone , left, situated"}]},{"text":"Der Schlüssel muss hier irgendwo sein.","en":"The key has to be here somewhere.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a key"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Er könnte noch irgendwo leben.","en":"He could still be alive somewhere.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"still / yet"},null,{"g":"a state in which…"}]}]}